{
    "title": "AllEvents - Discover Events",
    "description": "Live. Don't just exist.\r\nWith the AllEvents app, you can find events in any part of the world and make your day #happening.\r\n\r\nAs the world's largest Event Discovery Platform, we turn ordinary days into extraordinary memories. For you. For the memories you crave to create. For the communities you seek to engage.\r\n\r\nDiscover what's trending in your area with AllEvents. From local events in the neighborhood to blockbuster concerts and shows, stay in the loop with what's happening around you. Find out where your friends are headed and join the fun together.\r\nAllEvents not only simplifies the process of finding what's happening around you but also tailors suggestions to your interests, ensuring every outing is uniquely fulfilling.\r\n\r\nWith AllEvents app, you can\r\n\u2022 Discover local events on the go, whenever, wherever\r\n\u2022 See what's happening in your city\r\n\u2022 Find the best things to do around you during the week and on weekends\r\n\u2022 Get notified about new events from your favorite event organizers\r\n\u2022 Connect with your friends and know where they are going\r\n\u2022 Search from millions of events and get real-time details about the venue, schedule, and tickets\r\n\u2022 Get personalized event recommendations based on your interests\r\n\u2022 Explore the best events and get tickets\r\n\u2022 See all your ticket info in one convenient place\r\n\u2022 Add tickets to your Apple Passbook\r\n\u2022 Check in to your events just with your phone. (Paperless check-ins)\r\n\r\nEmbark on a journey of discovery and connection with AllEvents \u2013 where every event is an opportunity to be part of something bigger.\r\nDiscover events, book tickets, and make memories!\r\n#StayHappening with your personal events guide, AllEvents.\r\nAvailable across 30,000 cities across the globe.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Live. Don&#39;t just exist.<br>With the AllEvents app, you can find events in any part of the world and make your day #happening.<br><br>As the world&#39;s largest Event Discovery Platform, we turn ordinary days into extraordinary memories. For you. For the memories you crave to create. For the communities you seek to engage.<br><br>Discover what&#39;s trending in your area with AllEvents. From local events in the neighborhood to blockbuster concerts and shows, stay in the loop with what&#39;s happening around you. Find out where your friends are headed and join the fun together.<br>AllEvents not only simplifies the process of finding what&#39;s happening around you but also tailors suggestions to your interests, ensuring every outing is uniquely fulfilling.<br><br>With AllEvents app, you can<br>\u2022 Discover local events on the go, whenever, wherever<br>\u2022 See what&#39;s happening in your city<br>\u2022 Find the best things to do around you during the week and on weekends<br>\u2022 Get notified about new events from your favorite event organizers<br>\u2022 Connect with your friends and know where they are going<br>\u2022 Search from millions of events and get real-time details about the venue, schedule, and tickets<br>\u2022 Get personalized event recommendations based on your interests<br>\u2022 Explore the best events and get tickets<br>\u2022 See all your ticket info in one convenient place<br>\u2022 Add tickets to your Apple Passbook<br>\u2022 Check in to your events just with your phone. (Paperless check-ins)<br><br>Embark on a journey of discovery and connection with AllEvents \u2013 where every event is an opportunity to be part of something bigger.<br>Discover events, book tickets, and make memories!<br>#StayHappening with your personal events guide, AllEvents.<br>Available across 30,000 cities across the globe.",
